### Trip & Tracking — recorrido completo de la "Ruta 3" (datos demo: Seed:Demo=true, DevTokens:Enabled=true)
### Rider / VS / VS Code (REST Client). Ejecutar en orden: cada respuesta alimenta a las siguientes.

@host = http://localhost:5180

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health/live

###
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Tokens de desarrollo (mismo formato que IAM). En producción los emite IAM.
# @name driverToken
POST {{host}}/dev/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "DRIVER" }

###
# @name parentToken
POST {{host}}/dev/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "PARENT" }

###
# @name adminToken
POST {{host}}/dev/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "ADMIN" }

### 1. Agenda del conductor (hoy, hora de Lima)
# @name agenda
GET {{host}}/api/v1/drivers/me/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Iniciar el viaje de recojo (US-10). Reenviar el mismo clientEventId devuelve applied=false.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}" }

### 3. Lote de posiciones GPS (TS-15). Ajusta recordedAt a la hora actual en UTC.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tracking/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}",
  "readings": [
    { "latitude": -12.1050, "longitude": -77.0, "recordedAt": "{{$datetime iso8601}}", "accuracyMeters": 8, "speedKmh": 22 }
  ]
}

### 4. "Subió" Valeria (US-11)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/boardings
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}" }

### 5. "No vino" Mateo
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/absences
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002", "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}" }

### 6. Incidente (US-12): HEAVY_TRAFFIC / HeavyTraffic, RouteDeviation, VehicleFailure, StudentUnwell, Accident, Other
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/incidents
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}", "incidentType": "HEAVY_TRAFFIC", "notifyGuardians": true }

### 7. Cola offline (Store-and-Forward): Camila sube sin señal
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    { "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}", "type": "Boarding", "occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601}}", "studentId": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003" }
  ]
}

### 8. Vista del tutor (solo su hija y su parada, AC-01)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/live
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Posición rápida (Redis) — respaldo del hub SignalR /hubs/trip-tracking
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/position
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Viajes de mis hijos (tutor)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/guardians/me/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### 11. SOS (US-13) y atención por la empresa
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/sos/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### 12. Finalizar (US-14) y resumen
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientEventId": "{{$guid}}" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### 13. Panel de la empresa
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips?status=Completed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken.response.body.accessToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/track
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken.response.body.accessToken}}

### Sin token → 401 / tutor intentando una acción del conductor → 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/{{agenda.response.body.$[0].tripId}}/live
